blurb = "Depicts miners underground digging for gold in Sado province (modern-day Niigata prefecture).

This text explains the nature of gold in Sado. It mentions that gold is found as either sand gold (alluvial) or within rock veins. It describes the arduous process of extracting the ore from deep within the mountains and the refinement required to produce pure gold. The red labels highlight specific tasks like drainage."
